    "detailed_description": "Embark on a romantic comedy adventure commonly called \u201ccollege.\u201d Interact with 13 separate romantic interests in this choice-driven narrative with more than a dozen possible endings. Make the right choices, and you may find your way to a bedroom or two. But wait! There\u2019s more to this \u201cschool\u201d than meets the eye. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824610/extras/7ed1a0f7b4c28a73fe2a56f1640a72b9.avif?t=1721996815\" width=624 height=350 /></span><br>People have been going missing. Teachers are behaving weirdly. You meet a person in a bush. Are you being hunted? Navigate a world of decisions that can bring you closer to friendship or closer to death. Or both\u2026<br><br>This world is alive with dozens of locations. Music that softly pulls you further and further down the rabbit hole. Feel the weight of your decisions as lives and lovers hang in the balance. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824610/extras/a15ffa749864160d5b21538465ec965d.avif?t=1721996815\" width=624 height=350 /></span><br>Watch as you plead and beg to escape this world filled with light-hearted characters, comedic storytelling, romantic twists and turns, extreme violence at the drop of a hat, and memorable characters. <br><br>The people you meet have their own agendas, problems, pains, hopes, and dreams. It\u2019s up to you to find what you can do to help them\u2026 <br>  <br>Or what you can do to hurt them\u2026 <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824610/extras/a45c00ae2df1166c1bb56bd7ac0bc526.avif?t=1721996815\" width=624 height=350 /></span><br>Not everyone has your best interests at heart. Can you navigate this twisting story to find true love, or will you be face down in a ditch, forgotten and rotting?<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824610/extras/553fd08c317c809f2e99db5af4961dd1.avif?t=1721996815\" width=624 height=350 /></span>",
